nificance since it would be possible to perform such calculations in the devices. However, by delegating them to this component the devices save energy. • Dashboard: The Dashboard communicates with (1) the High-Level AR Actions API (ordering of actions, listing of actions, cancellation of actions, listing of WMS-AR exceptions) and (2) the Visualization Server, via a REST API over HTTP(S).
